! ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
! Linear solver for the StressSolver (Solver 5): DIRECT via MUMPS.
! Robust fallback for the incompressible [Disp:3 Pressure:1] saddle-point --
! MUMPS pivots through the indefiniteness, so NO Schur / preconditioner is needed
! and it converges where the iterative block-Schur path (un-exercised in Elmer for
! incompressible + Maxwell, see BPC_2.sif) does not.
! NOT weak-scalable: factorisation memory and time grow superlinearly, so this is
! for correctness / small-to-medium meshes, not the ultrafine scaling point.
! Included INSIDE Solver 5 -- Linear System keywords only.
! ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Linear System Solver = Direct
  Linear System Direct Method = "MUMPS"
  ! indefinite saddle-point -> extra pivoting fill-in; raise this if MUMPS reports
  ! insufficient workspace (INFO(1) = -8 / -9).
  Mumps Percentage Increase Working Space = Integer 100
